### Phase 4 - Chunking and Embeddings

#### Objectives
- Turn normalized documents into retrievable chunks.

#### Tasks
- [ ] Implement rag/chunker.py
  - chunk_documents(documents)
  - split large text while preserving metadata
- [ ] Implement rag/embedder.py
  - embed_documents(chunks)
  - generate embeddings using an OpenAI-compatible model
- [ ] Implement rag/vectorstore.py
  - upsert_documents(chunks)
