## 7. Definition of Done for the MVP

The MVP is considered complete when:
- the app can ingest CVE and ATT&CK data,
- questions can be answered with retrieved context,
- alerts can be generated from correlated events,
- the API responds successfully,
- the frontend can call the API and display results,
- the project can be started locally with Docker Compose or a virtual environment.

